cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use MsiaGen, please cite the model paper (preferred citation below) and the
  MsiaGen version you used, so that others can reproduce your results.
title: "MsiaGen: a stochastic daily weather generator for Malaysia"
abstract: >-
  MsiaGen generates daily minimum and maximum air temperature, wind speed and rainfall
  from monthly statistics, for perennial crop simulations in tropical Malaysia. It comes
  with a graphical app to design a site's weather statistics, run the generator and
  check how well the generated weather fits them.
type: software
authors:
